      "content": "Under CIF (Cost, Insurance, and Freight) Incoterms 2020, the seller is responsible for delivering the goods to the exporter's vessel at the named port of departure in Korea, before the carrier loads the goods onto the vessel. Once the goods are loaded onto the vessel, the seller's obligation ends. The seller is required to procure insurance against all risks of loss of or damage to the goods.",
