    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so just to clarify, if something happens to the components while they're transit across the ocean, who is actually responsible for filing the claim? and does the seller have to provide the insurance policy to us (the buyer) before it leaves korea?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
