      "content": "got it. one more thing - since the risk transfers to us once they're on the ship, how do we protect ourselves from unexpected delays or damage caused by rough seas? are there any specific clauses or extra insurance riders we should look for to make sure we aren't left hanging if the cargo gets messed up?",
